{{Passive skill box|Oath of Winter}}

'''Oath of Winter''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Warden]] that causes [[freeze]] applied to enemies to last a minimum of 2 seconds. In addition, if an enemy fails to become frozen due to insufficient freeze duration, it receives a stack of the Hoarfrost debuff, which increases freeze duration on the target per stack. All Hoarfrost is removed when the target becomes frozen.

==Mechanics==
{{c|mod|Enemies you Freeze remain Frozen for at least 2 seconds}}: If an enemy were to become afflicted with freeze and the duration of freeze would be less than 2 seconds, its duration is overridden to 2 seconds. Modifiers to freeze duration do not affect this minimum freeze duration.<ref>https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3532389/page/1#25</ref>

'''Hoarfrost:''' {{c|help|Hoarfrost lasts 10 seconds and can be inflicted multiple times, each refreshing the duration of existing Hoarfrost on the target. Each Hoarfrost increases the Freeze Duration on the target by 20%. All Hoarfrost is removed if the target is Frozen.}}

:Hoarfrost is a [[debuff]] and not an [[ailment]].<ref>https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3532389/page/1#26</ref> A hit must inflict a freeze of at least 1 millisecond (1/6000 of the monster's ailment threshold) to inflict Hoarfrost.<ref name="HoarfrostDuration"/>

